+"""Experiment 4815: audit .443 ARC nulls for silent under-coverage bugs.
+
+Spec refs: REQ-ARC-WMTE-4815, SCENARIO-ARC-WMTE-4815-SILENT-BUG-AUDIT,
+SCENARIO-ARC-WMTE-4815-BLOCKED-PRECONDITION.
+"""
+
